{"id":658,"slug":"withnail-and-i","title":"Withnail and I","year":1987,"country":"United Kingdom","duration":107,"spine":119,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/658-withnail-and-i","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/11fe63e2163ddad8d0b90410b694962a/wlzPkRYEwY3j5dey42L3alx8d9Uy2x_large.jpg","description":"The ultimate cult British comedy, Bruce Robinson’s semi-autobiographical cinematic bender is a feast of delectably florid dialogue delivered with deadpan relish by stars Richard E. Grant and Paul McGann as, respectively, Withnail and “I,” a pair of perpetually soused, unemployed actors in 1960s London who, desperate to escape their nightmarishly grimy flat, embark on a hilariously misbegotten country getaway beset by menacing locals, bare cupboards, and a randy uncle—all of which they may be able to withstand as long as they don’t run out of alcohol. While Robinson’s dazzling script yields quotable moments galore, it’s the film’s bittersweet evocation of a friendship gradually unraveling that gives this beloved end-of-youth tale its lasting poignancy.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Bruce Robinson","slug":"bruce-robinson"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Paul McGann","role":"Marwood (“I”)","slug":"paul-mcgann"},{"actor":"Richard E. Grant","role":"Withnail","slug":"richard-e-grant"},{"actor":"Richard Griffiths","role":"Monty","slug":"richard-griffiths"},{"actor":"Ralph Brown","role":"Danny","slug":"ralph-brown"},{"actor":"Michael Elphick","role":"Jake","slug":"michael-elphick"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Bruce Robinson","slug":"bruce-robinson"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Bruce Robinson","slug":"bruce-robinson"},{"role":"Produced by","person":"Paul Heller","slug":null},{"role":"Produced in association with","person":"Lawrence Kirstein","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"George Harrison","slug":"george-harrison"},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Denis O’Brien","slug":null},{"role":"Coproducer","pers